#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__actual_work_time_cost
msgid "Actual Work Time Cost"
msgstr "Costo del tempo di lavoro effettivo"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_night_supplement
msgid ""
"Additive night-shift supplement (НСОРЗ чл. 8) applied to every night hour "
"worked — regular, overtime or holiday — on top of the rates above."
msgstr ""
"Добавъчна нощна добавка (НСОРЗ чл. 8), прилагана към всеки отработен нощен "
"час — редовен, извънреден или в официален празник — в допълнение към "
"горепосочените ставки."

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.view_hr_attendance_extra_form_inherit
msgid "Cost breakdown"
msgstr "Разбивка на разходите"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_regular
msgid ""
"Cost of hours worked inside the schedule at the base rate (hourly cost × "
"actual work time)."
msgstr ""
"Стойност на отработените часове в рамките на графика по основна ставка "
"(почасова стойност × действително отработено време)."

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_overtime
msgid ""
"Cost of overtime worked on a working day, at the КТ чл. 262 working-day "
"multiplier."
msgstr ""
"Стойност на извънредния труд в работен ден, по коефициент за работен ден "
"съгласно КТ чл. 262."

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_extra
msgid ""
"Cost of work performed on a rest day or official holiday, at the КТ чл. 262 "
"rest-day or holiday multiplier (holiday detected from Public Holidays)."
msgstr ""
"Стойност на труда, положен в почивен ден или официален празник, по "
"коефициент за почивен ден или официален празник съгласно КТ чл. 262 "
"(официалният празник се определя от Официални празници)."

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__currency_id
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "Valuta"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__currency_id
msgid ""
"Currency for cost calculations (derived from employee).\n"
"        \n"
"        • Source: Automatically inherited from employee's currency\n"
"        • Purpose: Ensures consistent currency for all cost calculations\n"
"        • Read-only: Cannot be changed directly\n"
"        \n"
"        Note: All monetary fields use this currency for proper formatting and calculations."
msgstr ""
"Valuta per il calcolo dei costi (derivata dal dipendente).\n"
"        \n"
"        • Origine: ereditata automaticamente dalla valuta del dipendente\n"
"        • Scopo: garantisce una valuta coerente per tutti i calcoli dei costi\n"
"        • Sola lettura: non può essere modificata direttamente\n"
"        \n"
"        Nota: tutti i campi monetari utilizzano questa valuta per la corretta formattazione e i calcoli."

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Nome visualizzato"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__hourly_cost
msgid ""
"Employee's hourly cost rate (derived from employee record).\n"
"        \n"
"        • Source: Copied from employee's hourly cost setting\n"
"        • Access: Visible to HR users only\n"
"        • Usage: Base rate for calculating actual work time costs\n"
"        \n"
"        Note: Update the employee's hourly cost to change this value."
msgstr ""
"Tariffa del costo orario del dipendente (derivata dal record del dipendente).\n"
"        \n"
"        • Origine: copiata dall'impostazione del costo orario del dipendente\n"
"        • Accesso: visibile solo agli utenti HR\n"
"        • Utilizzo: tariffa base per il calcolo dei costi del tempo di lavoro effettivo\n"
"        \n"
"        Nota: aggiornare il costo orario del dipendente per modificare questo valore."

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model,name:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.model_hr_attendance_extra
msgid "Extra work time calculations"
msgstr "Calcolo del tempo di lavoro straordinario"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__hourly_cost
msgid "Hourly Cost"
msgstr "Costo orario"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_night_supplement
msgid "Night Supplement"
msgstr "Нощна добавка"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_overtime
msgid "Overtime Cost"
msgstr "Стойност на извънреден труд"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_regular
msgid "Regular Cost"
msgstr "Редовна стойност"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__cost_extra
msgid "Rest-day / Holiday Cost"
msgstr "Стойност за почивен ден / официален празник"

#. module: hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendace_rfid_hr_hourly_cost.field_hr_attendance_extra__actual_work_time_cost
msgid ""
"Total labour cost for the day: regular hours plus overtime and rest-"
"day/holiday premiums, plus the night-shift supplement. Uses the legal rates "
"effective on this date, so past days keep their historical coefficients."
msgstr ""
"Обща стойност на труда за деня: редовни часове плюс извънреден труд и "
"добавки за почивен ден/официален празник, плюс нощна добавка. Използва "
"законовите ставки, действащи към тази дата, така минали дни запазват своите "
"исторически коефициенти."
